Ini jalan mati?

120
00:10:46,771 --> 00:10:48,564
Tingginya!

121
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:58,114
Apa kita nak buat, Usopp?

122
00:10:58,115 --> 00:11:01,368
Awak cakap "halusinasi", bukan, Nami?

123
00:11:01,369 --> 00:11:02,577
Apa?

124
00:11:02,578 --> 00:11:05,206
Kalau begitu, kucing itu...

125
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:07,792
Kita memang nampak, tapi ia mungkin cuma...

126
00:11:10,503 --> 00:11:12,129
satu halusinasi!

127
00:11:15,257 --> 00:11:16,717
Marilah!

128
00:11:27,228 --> 00:11:29,730
Usopp!

129
00:11:43,119 --> 00:11:44,203
Usopp...

130
00:11:48,541 --> 00:11:52,545
Tidak!

131
00:12:20,281 --> 00:12:21,865
Aduh...

132
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:23,742
Saya masih hidup?

133
