Gear Tiga!

146
00:14:14,812 --> 00:14:17,147
Nami!

147
00:14:19,441 --> 00:14:22,318
Sebab buat orang saya suka menangis...

148
00:14:22,319 --> 00:14:23,195
Hukuman mati!

149
00:14:30,327 --> 00:14:31,829
Ifrit Jambe!

150
00:14:36,458 --> 00:14:38,168
Gaya Tiga Pedang.

151
00:14:39,795 --> 00:14:42,047
Kuasa Getah...

152
00:14:42,673 --> 00:14:44,633
Cemeti...

153
00:14:45,968 --> 00:14:47,303
Serangan...

154
00:14:48,345 --> 00:14:50,639
Taufan...

155
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,895
Naga Tali Hitam!

156
00:15:00,691 --> 00:15:02,568
Gajah!

157
00:15:08,032 --> 00:15:09,491
Épaule!

158
00:15:36,644 --> 00:15:38,562
Hampir-hampir saja...

159
00:15:42,816 --> 00:15:45,151
Apa? Ia jadi kucing.

160
00:15:45,152 --> 00:15:47,445
Besarnya!

161
00:15:47,446 --> 00:15:49,782
Tapi, saya tak mahu makan ini.

162
00:15:50,366 --> 00:15:53,869
Arnab bakar tadi sangat sedap!

163
00:15:54,828 --> 00:15:56,956
Nami!

164
00:15:57,539 --> 00:15:59,792
Saya risaukan awak!

165
00:16:01,752 --> 00:16:04,879
Sanji, saya takut betul!

166
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:07,131
Usopp mati, dan...

167
00:16:07,132 --> 00:16:09,301
Mesti awak begitu takut.

168
00:16:09,802 --> 00:16:12,845
Saya pasti dia gembira
untuk mati demi awak.

169
00:16:12,846 --> 00:16:14,848
Saya masih hidup...

170
00:16:15,724 --> 00:16:21,438
Celaka, saya tak akan lupakan
awak jadikan saya perisai!

171
00:16:35,828 --> 00:16:36,954
Apa itu?

172
00:16:39,999 --> 00:16:41,708
Apa pula kali ini?

173
00:16:41,709 --> 00:16:43,209
- Sekali lagi?
- Apa?

174
00:16:43,210 --> 00:16:46,087
Nampaknya ada yang lebih besar.

175
00:16:46,088 --> 00:16:48,423
Jika sedap, saya akan kalahkannya.

176
00:16:48,424 --> 00:16:51,426
Kita perlu cari laut dan kapal dulu.

177
00:16:51,427 --> 00:16:53,429
Kita tak tahu sama ada kru kita selamat.

178
00:16:54,013 --> 00:16:55,972
Bercakap tentang makanan,

179
00:16:55,973 --> 00:16:58,767
sarang lebah dan lebah madu
awak humban tadi...

180
00:17:00,436 --> 00:17:04,522
Itu boleh jadi bekalan yang bagus
dan ia penuh khasiat.

181
00:17:04,523 --> 00:17:08,109
Yakah? Membazir betul.

182
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:09,027
Bukan?

183
00:17:09,028 --> 00:17:10,153
Cakaplah awal-awal.

184
00:17:10,154 --> 00:17:11,362
Apa?

185
00:17:11,363 --> 00:17:13,573
Kenapa kamu semua begitu selesa?

186
00:17:13,574 --> 00:17:15,242
Tempat apa ini?

187
00:17:17,786 --> 00:17:21,122
Hei, macam mana kamu sampai sini?

188
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:26,502
Saya terjaga di belakang kampung itu,
berjalan ke arah kekecohan,

189
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:29,005
dan jumpa dia sedang
belasah arnab gergasi.

190
00:17:29,006 --> 00:17:32,633
Awak boleh saja kalahkan
kucing-singa itu, Usopp.

191
00:17:32,634 --> 00:17:35,929
Sedar-sedar, saya dah dalam
mulut kucing itu! Jadi, saya panik.

192
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:42,019
Apa?

193
00:17:48,942 --> 00:17:50,903
Kuasa getah

194
00:17:52,488 --> 00:17:54,156
Belon!

195
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,502
Aduh...

196
00:18:07,503 --> 00:18:08,961
Hampir-hampir saja.

197
00:18:08,962 --> 00:18:13,925
Antara raksasa-raksasa gergasi
dan istana palsu itu,

198
00:18:13,926 --> 00:18:16,761
jika dunia ini bukan halusinasi...

199
00:18:16,762 --> 00:18:19,056
Adakah ia mimpi?

200
00:18:19,556 --> 00:18:20,641
Tidak.

201
00:18:21,308 --> 00:18:23,143
Jika ini mimpi,

202
00:18:24,603 --> 00:18:26,896
tak mungkin lelaki akan muncul.

203
00:18:26,897 --> 00:18:29,191
Awak selalu mimpi apa?

204
00:18:30,192 --> 00:18:31,777
Baiklah, Nami...

205
00:18:34,029 --> 00:18:35,489
Mari lompat!

206
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:37,658
Apa?

207
00:19:10,274 --> 00:19:11,650
Peliknya.

208
00:19:12,234 --> 00:19:14,278
Tak ada angin langsung.

209
00:19:21,410 --> 00:19:23,035
Begitu...

210
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:23,871
Apa?

211
00:19:25,414 --> 00:19:27,665
Adakah ini pokok?

212
00:19:27,666 --> 00:19:29,418
Ini pendapat saya.

213
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,128
Daripada apa saya faham,

214
00:19:32,129 --> 00:19:35,965
kita telah dipakaikan pakaian
pahlawan Elbaf.

215
00:19:35,966 --> 00:19:40,386
Tapi, di negara gergasi,
tak mungkin mereka ada

216
00:19:40,387 --> 00:19:42,722
pakaian dalam saiz kita.

217
00:19:42,723 --> 00:19:47,351
Sekejap, awak maksudkan kita di Elbaf
dan telah membesar?

218
00:19:47,352 --> 00:19:49,312
Saya dah jadi gergasi?

219
00:19:49,313 --> 00:19:51,189
Tak mungkin.

220
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:54,817
Sekalipun ada antara kru kita di sini,
tak semuanya ada di sini.

221
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:55,986
Macam mana awak tahu?

222
00:19:58,071 --> 00:20:00,573
Radar saya tak dapat kesan Robin.

223
00:20:00,574 --> 00:20:01,490
Awak ini anjing?

224
00:20:01,491 --> 00:20:03,117
Oh ya!

225
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:06,454
Jika kita mencari laut,
kita mungkin boleh jumpa Sunny.

226
00:20:06,455 --> 00:20:07,997
Jadi, mereka semua akan...

227
00:20:07,998 --> 00:20:10,499
Tengoklah betapa besarnya tempat ini.

228
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,877
Tak mungkin kita boleh pergi sampai laut.

229
00:20:12,878 --> 00:20:14,004
Tempat ini luas betul.

230
00:20:14,588 --> 00:20:16,756
Nampaknya ada orang di pekan itu.

231
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:21,260
Kita tak boleh ke mana-mana
sehingga kita tanya orang lokasi kita.

232
00:20:21,261 --> 00:20:22,971
Mari pergi ke pekan!

233
00:20:23,555 --> 00:20:27,183
Jika kita tanya pada orang,
mari cari gadis yang cantik.

234
00:20:27,184 --> 00:20:28,809
Seriuslah sedikit!

235
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:30,561
Pekan itu bukan arah situ, Zoro!

236
00:20:30,562 --> 00:20:31,688
Yakah?

237
00:20:33,982 --> 00:20:36,317
Macam mana kamu boleh begitu seronok?

238
00:20:36,318 --> 00:20:40,112
Kamu sedar tak betapa menakutkan
tempat ini?

239
00:20:40,113 --> 00:20:44,076
Nami, cerialah sedikit!
Saya setuju dengan awak!

240
00:20:44,576 --> 00:20:46,827
Jika tempat ini bukan Elbaf,

241
00:20:46,828 --> 00:20:51,124
hati saya sentiasa dipenuhi cinta
demi awak!

242
00:20:52,501 --> 00:20:57,505
Jika ini Elbaf, saya ingat saya akan
dapat tengok jongkong emas gergasi.

243
00:20:57,506 --> 00:20:59,216
Maksud awak, "curi", bukan?

244
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:02,678
Baiklah! Mari ke pekan dan bertanya!

245
00:21:03,345 --> 00:21:05,013
Ya! Mari pergi!

246
00:21:05,806 --> 00:21:07,807
Mari kita pergi mengembara!

247
00:21:07,808 --> 00:21:10,143
Ya!

248
00:21:12,562 --> 00:21:21,070
<i>Elbaf!</i>

249
00:21:21,071 --> 00:21:24,615
<i>Semuanya besar sebab mereka Gergasi!</i>

250
00:21:24,616 --> 00:21:30,539
{\an8}BERSAMBUNG

251
00:23:05,801 --> 00:23:08,511
<i>Luffy dan yang lain
mengembara di negara misteri.</i>

252
00:23:08,512 --> 00:23:12,932
<i>Di sebalik blok-blok permainan ini,
mereka menemui kuil Dewa Matahari.</i>

253
00:23:12,933 --> 00:23:15,268
<i>Mungkinkah ini Elbaf?</i>

254
00:23:15,894 --> 00:23:21,232
<i>Sewaktu mereka cuba lari dari Negara Blok,
sesuatu yang merisaukan semakin dekat.</i>

255
00:23:21,233 --> 00:23:22,900
<i>Episod seterusnya dalam</i> ONE PIECE!

256
00:23:22,901 --> 00:23:26,237
<i>"Misi di Negara Misteri!
Rahsia Dewa Matahari"</i>

257
00:23:26,238 --> 00:23:28,865
Saya akan jadi Raja Lanun!

258
00:23:30,742 --> 00:23:36,623
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Fikri D. Dali

